  dialogueDictionary:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: David_Ellipsis
      Value: ...
    - Key: David_Shocked
      Value: '!!!'
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_01
      Value: Ah... What a predictable outcome. A mere human, brash, reckless and
        utterly lacking in grace as usual. Smashing through my ancient, irreplaceable
        castle walls with... this.
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_02
      Value: Well, since you seem so eager to part with your possessions... I shall
        take this.
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_03
      Value: Yes... a fitting compensation for the insult you have delivered upon
        my home.
    - Key: Dracula_OpeningDialogue_04
      Value: As for you, I would suggest you scram!
